      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi ghwajoar fuga Amoni ea fuga Shaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghang'ata hiji ghami sugoocheanda Amoni, ak gawa orjeedaanyi hoorgeadaanyi goombaliischi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi Dawdi, “Gaydasissa ng'asheega miyaasiin Hanuni orjeeda Nahashi, aba gideaba ghwaan gwasinnean ng'asheega miyaas.” Ng'ata goojeakta Dawdi giijasoodiga gooloong'sa niny aba iita ghwaan. Ak ghapka fuga gadiyeeda Dawdi heeda Hanuni aba ng'eanyiida Amoni, ak gooloong'sa niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda fuga hees bea eemeeda Amoni ak gwayeesha Hanuni, “Ang'iing'i giyeenayi Dawdi goojeagu fuga buwa giiloong'siinda aba gideaba gwasissa mureeda gweanu? Neada fiisu bea gadiyeedean ea mwapka gheang'da nea goosheakshi nea gagasa ghabwaay ng'eanyiida?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu Hanuni fuga gadiyeeda Dawdi, ak ghwareakgh saawa, nea ghwalajaada bugusuunatka hang'weaka nyaawa ak ghwanung' gabiikuuna gibeesuuka nyaawa, ak ghwanung' gaweay; hean ghang'eat ng'eat gaweay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea geerukusa Dawdi iita buuneeda, goojeakta buuneeda gwaroonyi saawa, aba gideaba buuneeda nibwaspwas muuchi. Ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha, “Abiidana Yeriko ea gwardu deamuukeagwa, ak abeeda goobiigu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwadaah fuga Amoni gideaba saawa niiw fuga munyas aba heeda Dawdi, gageanu Hanuni sea fuga Amoni ak ghwanung' eayaat dalaantaji sagalama bea lapiya ghwashaaha mutukwajeega ea fuga ding'da faraasajeega aba ng'eanyiida Mesopotamiya, ea Aramaka, ea Soba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha mutukwaji sagalamnyooji diktam ea damaniyeenya sea sugoocheanda Maaka ea lugoadaanyi, ak ghapka ak gawus aba madeeda Medeba. Ak ghabwat geat fuga Amoni aba mujiinajeega nyaawa ak ghapka ng'ucheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwanyas iita, goojeakta Yoabu sea lugoosean was fuga mideawa uurjeenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghapka fuga Amoni ak gwajip geat nea gwasina geenga aba ghuuta mujiini, nea sugoodiga buwa gwandeawa geat aba heeda bwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean daah Yoabu gideaba ng'ucheeda geekeal niny aba mwadi ea bwadaw, gagwalu fuga mwaatkwa siloat bea Israeli, ak gwajip gang'uchi sea fuga Shaamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea fuga abit ghwayiin geatinga Abishayi was orjeeda ghaamwat ghoahaaghwa, ak geebada gang'uchi sea fuga Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi, “Iideepa gaburdeawean uurda fuga Shaamu abeeda gayweadaan; ama deepa gaburdeaweey uurda fuga Amoni, abeeda gaydaweanyi ang'iing'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi daruusiida, amajeega geaw aba badayda buuneedeanya, ea aba badayda mujiinajeega ASEETEANYA; ak gagasa gwasin NG'UTAMIIDA gidadaah gideaba ghwahit aba headaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwaneekiit Yoabu sea fuga mideawa ak ghapka madeeda fuga Shaamu gang'uchi; ak gamng'aw aba madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea fuga Amoni gideaba gamng'aw fuga Shaamu, gamng'aw eara saawa aba madeeda Abishayi, was orjeeda geenyea Yoabu, ak gaweay jeeda mujiini. Ng'ata ghwaan Yoabu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah fuga Shaamu gideaba nijoar saawa fuga Israeli goojeakta giijasoodiga ak gweadu fuga Shaamu mida giigheawda Furati, sea Shofaki was shirikarajeanda haw bea lugooda Hadadeseri ak goosheedeawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea geerukusa Dawdi, ghabwada geat Israeleesean; ak ghoaghaawa Yordani, ak ghapka roonyeeda, ak ghwanung' ghapka lugoadaanyi gang'uchi sea saawa. Iidu nea gwajip Dawdi lugooda gang'uchi sea fuga Shaamu hean gang'uchi sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gamng'aw fuga Shaamu aba madeeda Israeli; ak ghabwar Dawdi fuga Shaamu sagalamnyooji ispwa mideawa mutukwajeega, ea shirikareeda beawa geeshanga sagalamnyooji haradam, ak ghabwar eara Shofaki was shirikarajeanda haw ambal lugooda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah fuga gadiyeeda Hadadeseri gideaba Israeli nijoar saawa, gagasa duupcheeda aba heeda Dawdi, ak gagadiiyeesa niny. Ak ghaheawa fuga Shaamu gideaba gaygabiikta ghaweat fuga Amoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
